{61}{No...there's no more iron in those caves, boy.  Took a fair amount out, myself.  Only thing left in the Dredge is dark and monsters.  Not a place you want to be takin' a stroll in.  It's a shame, too...I lost something down there a long time ago, but no one goes in there anymore.  Orders of the King, and all that...}{No...there's no more iron in those caves, girl.  Took a fair amount out, myself.  Only thing left in the Dredge is dark and monsters.  Not a place you want to be takin' a stroll in.  It's a shame, too...I lost something down there a long time ago, but no one goes in there anymore.  Orders of the King, and all that...}{}{}{}{lf3 1}
