{81}{Hmmm.  I don't know...there are always guards at the entrance to the Dredge, and I wouldn't want you to cause any trouble.  BUT!  If you happen to get permission to go into those old caves and came out with my heirloom, I might be willing to give you a stout dwarven miner's helmet...it's good for seeing in the dark....}{Hmmm.  I don't know...there are always guards at the entrance to the Dredge, and I wouldn't want you to cause any trouble.  BUT!  If you happen to get permission to go into those old caves and came out with my heirloom, I might be willing to give you a stout dwarven miner's helmet...it's good for seeing in the dark....}{}{}{}{qu1092 1}
