{87}{There's two things you need to do.  First of all, there's an old key I lost somewhere in the caves.  Once you find that, you need to find a door in one of the cave walls...it was carved right into the stone, and only that key will open it.  Behind that door is a black, wooden box.  In that box is the heirloom.  Good luck to you, lad...}{There's two things you need to do.  First of all, there's an old key I lost somewhere in the caves.  Once you find that, you need to find a door in one of the cave walls...it was carved right into the stone, and only that key will open it.  Behind that door is a black, wooden box.  In that box is the heirloom.  Good luck to you...}{}{}{}{}
