{125}{Long ago, I lost a key.  That key opens the door to a secret room deep within the caverns of the Dredge, a room I carved out with my own hands.  In that room is an old family heirloom, and I'd love to see it again before I die.  I used to go looking for the key, but once they closed the Dredge, I could no longer do so...}{Long ago, I lost a key.  That key opens the door to a secret room deep within the caverns of the Dredge, a room I carved out with my own hands.  In that room is an old family heirloom, and I'd love to see it again before I die.  I used to go looking for the key, but once they closed the Dredge, I could no longer do so...}{}{}{}{lf4 1}
