{140}{You've done me a great service, my friend!  I thank you from the bottom of my stone heart!}{You've done me a great service, my friend!  I thank you from the bottom of my stone heart!}{}{}{}{}
{141}{[He laughs.]  Yes, I suppose I could have told you what you were looking for.  This wagon has been in my family for 1000 years...legend says it was the first thing ever made by my great-grandfather, when he was but a child. }{[He laughs.]  Yes, I suppose I could have told you what you were looking for.  This wagon has been in my family for 1000 years...legend says it was the first thing ever made by my great-grandfather, when he was but a child. }{}{}{}{}
{142}{Yes, but all the danger...and you've waited for so long...for a toy...}{}{5}{}{145}{}
