{145}{[He smiles, warmly.]  Is it so hard to believe?  Were you expecting some ancient dwarven artifact, perhaps some lost piece of technology? [He laughs.]  In this world of magick and myth, is it impossible that something as simple as a toy wagon might have value?  A valuable lesson, friend...oftentimes, you find power in the most insignificant things.  Good day to you...}{[He smiles, warmly.]  Is it so hard to believe?  Were you expecting some ancient dwarven artifact, perhaps some lost piece of technology? [He laughs.]  In this world of magick and myth, is it impossible that something as simple as a toy wagon might have value?  A valuable lesson, friend...oftentimes, you find power in the most insignificant things.  Good day to you...}{}{}{}{}
