{195}{Not much else to tell.  We've a few shopkeepers here and there, and they're always willing to make someone a deal.  All in all, we're good folk here in the Wheel Clan, but don't get out of line.  With the Dredge, and the King gone...well...be that as it may.  Just watch your step around here...}{Not much else to tell.  We've a few shopkeepers here and there, and they're always willing to make someone a deal.  All in all, we're good folk here in the Wheel Clan, but don't get out of line.  With the Dredge, and the King gone...well...be that as it may.  Just watch your step around here...}{}{}{}{}
